    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nVIEWINGS BY APPOINTMENT\nSuperb A rated one, two, three and four bedroom with study homes, in a wonderful boutique development adjacent to Prosperous village and offering all the ingredients required for modern living with convenience to the city.Bower Court promises to be an exclusive development of just 10 homes that will boast efficient, modern layouts, attractive fittings and finishes combined with modern materials and energy efficient features ensuring they will be wonderful homes in a delightful village setting.Prosperous village is a wonderful setting with an array of excellent amenities and services including shops, schools (primary and secondary), church, cafes, restaurants, crèches, playground and a wide range of sporting an recreational facilities.Residents of Bower Court will be able to enjoy the convenience of all these local services whilst still being within an easy commute of Dublin city and its surrounding areas via a frequent bus service, rail links from Sallins and Maynooth combined with easy access to the M4 and M7 motorways. \n• Route 120 (Dublin Edenderry / Newbridge): Operated by Go-Ahead Ireland, connecting Prosperous to Dublin city centre (Wellington Quay, Heuston Station, Connolly Station), Liffey Valley SC, Clane, and Newbridge or Edenderry. Operates daily, including weekends and public holidays.\n• Route 821 (Newbridge Sallins Train Station): Operated by TFI Local Link Kildare South Dublin, passing through Prosperous and connecting to regional rail links at Sallins and Newbridge, as well as Naas, Coill Dubh, and Robertstown. Operates Monday to Sunday with extended late-evening departures on Fridays and Saturdays.\n\nPlans and specifications available for inspection upon request.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE THAT SOME IMAGES HAVE BEEN VIRTUALLY STAGED**"
      },
